DATABASE ARCHITECTURE & ER DIAGRAM
Hostel Complaint Raising Platform
Date: March 7, 2026

1. ENTITY RELATIONSHIP (ER) OVERVIEW

Relationships:
- USER (Student) raises 0 to many COMPLAINTS.
- USER (Recipient) receives 0 to many NOTIFICATIONS.
- COMPLAINT contains 0 to many ATTACHMENTS (Images/Videos).
- WARDEN/ADMIN manages 0 to many COMPLAINTS.

Entity Definitions:

[USER Entity]
- ID (Primary Key, UUID)
- Name (String)
- Email (String, Unique)
- Password Hash (String)
- Role (Enum: student, warden, admin)
- Block (String: A, B, C, etc.)
- Room (String)
- Mobile (String)
- Parent Mobile (String)
- Residency Status (Enum: stayed, not-in-hostel, left-hostel, graduated)
- Created At (Datetime)

[COMPLAINT Entity]
- ID (Primary Key, e.g., C-1001)
- Student ID (Foreign Key -> USER.id)
- Title (String)
- Description (Text)
- Category (String)
- Priority (Enum: Low, Medium, High)
- Status (Enum: Pending, In Progress, Resolved, Escalated, etc.)
- Block (String)
- Room (String)
- Created At (Datetime)
- Resolved By (Foreign Key -> USER.id)
- Resolution Comment (Text)

[NOTIFICATION Entity]
- ID (Primary Key, UUID)
- User ID (Foreign Key -> USER.id)
- Message (Text)
- Is Read (Boolean)
- Type (String: status_change, new_complaint, etc.)
- Created At (Datetime)

[ATTACHMENT Entity]
- ID (Primary Key, UUID)
- Complaint ID (Foreign Key -> COMPLAINT.id)
- File URL (Text)
- File Type (String: image, video)
- Uploaded At (Datetime)

------------------------------------------------------------------

2. TABLE SCHEMAS

TABLE: users
| Column            | Type    | Constraints       | Description                                  |
|-------------------|---------|-------------------|----------------------------------------------|
| id                | UUID    | PK, Not Null      | Unique identifier for the user.              |
| name              | VARCHAR | Not Null          | Full name of the user.                       |
| email             | VARCHAR | Unique, Not Null  | Email used for login.                        |
| role              | ENUM    | Not Null          | Role: student, warden, admin.                |
| residency_status  | ENUM    | Default 'stayed'  | stayed, no-hostel, left-hostel, graduated.   |
| block             | VARCHAR |                   | Hostel block assignment.                     |
| room              | VARCHAR |                   | Room number assignment.                      |

TABLE: complaints
| Column            | Type    | Constraints       | Description                                  |
|-------------------|---------|-------------------|----------------------------------------------|
| id                | VARCHAR | PK, Not Null      | Prefixed ID (e.g., C-1001).                  |
| student_id        | UUID    | FK (users.id)     | Submitting student's ID.                     |
| title             | VARCHAR | Not Null          | Short summary of issue.                      |
| status            | ENUM    | Default 'Pending' | Pending, In Progress, Resolved, Escalated.   |
| priority          | ENUM    | Default 'Medium'  | Low, Medium, High.                           |
| block             | VARCHAR | Not Null          | Location block.                              |
| room              | VARCHAR | Not Null          | Location room.                               |

TABLE: attachments
| Column            | Type    | Constraints       | Description                                  |
|-------------------|---------|-------------------|----------------------------------------------|
| id                | UUID    | PK                | Unique attachment ID.                        |
| complaint_id      | VARCHAR | FK                | Reference to parent complaint.               |
| file_url          | TEXT    | Not Null          | Storage path or URL.                         |
| file_type         | VARCHAR |                   | 'image' or 'video'.                          |

TABLE: notifications
| Column            | Type    | Constraints       | Description                                  |
|-------------------|---------|-------------------|----------------------------------------------|
| id                | UUID    | PK                | Unique notification ID.                      |
| user_id           | UUID    | FK (users.id)     | Recipient user.                              |
| message           | TEXT    | Not Null          | Alert content.                               |
| is_read           | BOOLEAN | Default FALSE     | Read tracking.                               |

------------------------------------------------------------------

